02:43:17.260 --> 02:43:19.600
We just need all to talk about this.

02:43:19.600 --> 02:43:25.720
If you have some challenges believing in this,
A, you can make your own research on trying

02:43:25.720 --> 02:43:29.880
to understand whether we are right with our
data and our points of view.

02:43:29.880 --> 02:43:32.700
B, you can ask a question in the forum.

02:43:32.700 --> 02:43:35.900
You can find a way to reach us out and ask
a question.

02:43:35.900 --> 02:43:41.750
So we will explain how we see this until you
believe this is actually the really, really,

02:43:41.750 --> 02:43:44.010
really good way of investing your money.

02:43:44.010 --> 02:43:48.990
Tim Ferriss: Well, also, this conversation
has raised so many good questions.

02:43:48.990 --> 02:43:55.720
One of which is how do you take capital, which
is a currency, it's something that you can

02:43:55.720 --> 02:44:03.040
exchange for other things that is currently
locked in a somewhat static form that may

02:44:03.040 --> 02:44:06.490
not be generating much positive value in the
world.

02:44:06.490 --> 02:44:13.649
And how do you liberate that for other faster
growing, more dynamic sources of value, not

02:44:13.649 --> 02:44:18.090
just for the individual, but for the community,
for society?

02:44:18.090 --> 02:44:20.450
And I think about that a lot.

02:44:20.450 --> 02:44:28.010
It's asset allocation, but on sort of a karmically
considered level, at least at the collective.

02:44:28.010 --> 02:44:31.220
David Liberman: And you don't need to spend
the money which you need right now.

02:44:31.220 --> 02:44:34.430
It is money which —
Daniil Liberman: You will only get access

02:44:34.430 --> 02:44:35.569
like in 30 years from now.

02:44:35.569 --> 02:44:38.410
David Liberman: — so we made an experiment
when we joined Snap.

02:44:38.410 --> 02:44:40.260
It was first time in our life when we got
401K.

02:44:40.260 --> 02:44:41.700
Daniil Liberman: First time in our life employed.

02:44:41.700 --> 02:44:42.700
David Liberman: Yes.

02:44:42.700 --> 02:44:43.700
Yes.

02:44:43.700 --> 02:44:45.340
We never —
