02:45:33.270 --> 02:45:35.510
David Liberman: So, in essence, it's just
[inaudible]

02:45:35.510 --> 02:45:36.760
Daniil Liberman: That's the funniest part.

02:45:36.760 --> 02:45:40.431
David Liberman: — so if you believe that
other people believe in the same, and that

02:45:40.431 --> 02:45:47.680
